      <transcript>CUBURIΓUL-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus, of cuburi-] To cause to follow in a single file; to shed(as tears or blood).</definition>
      <page>204</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠳᠦᠨ ᠤ ᠨᠢᠯᠪᠤᠰᠤᠨ ᠢ ᠴᠣᠪᠣᠷᠢᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>nidyn y nilbusun i --xu</transcript>
          <definition>To shed tears.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
